        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International PH-4803, Traditional Twisted Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe twisted door pull made by RK International has a traditional style that manages to be fancy without being overly so. It will add character to any door (including on appliances) with its twist design. The 12 Inch Twisted Door Handle comes packaged with the mounting hardware. It is available in 7 finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/twist-cabinet-pull-rk-international-cp-800\"><b>Twist Cabinet Pull</b></a> and \r\n<a href=\"/products/twisted-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-702\"><b>Twist Cabinet Knob</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the PH-4803 12 Inch Twist Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 13-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
